are interested.

775
00:35:06,860 --> 00:35:10,060
So again, these little absorption lines here correspond

776
00:35:10,060 --> 00:35:13,460
to specific atmospheric events, interactions of that

777
00:35:13,460 --> 00:35:16,660
particular wavelength of light, with some molecule

778
00:35:16,660 --> 00:35:19,740
usually in the atmosphere.

779
00:35:19,740 --> 00:35:22,900
We can as well have generalized attenuation due to other

780
00:35:22,900 --> 00:35:24,140
scattering mechanisms.

781
00:35:24,140 --> 00:35:26,580
Notice right here in the short wavelengths what's

782
00:35:26,580 --> 00:35:28,540
